## ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
## PlanMeter .gitignore  —  WPF on .NET 8, Windows-only v1
## ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
artifacts/
publish/
bld/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
x64/
x86/

### Build / app logs   (SEC-04: app writes under %LOCALAPPDATA%\PlanMeter\logs;
###                      never commit any log file, anywhere in the tree)
*.log
*.binlog
*.tlog
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

### NuGet   (PackageReference-only — no packages/ folder expected)
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json

### Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace
*.user
*.userosscache
*.suo
*.rsuser
*.sln.docstates
*.tmp_proj
*.dbmdl
*.dbproj.schemaview
*.jfm

### ReSharper / analyzers
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
*.DotSettings.user

### Test results & coverage
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage/

### Code-signing & strong-name keys  (CRITICAL for Phase 6 — never commit)
*.pfx
*.pvk
*.snk

### Local secrets   (SEC-01/04 defense-in-depth: never commit any credential-shaped file)
*.key.bin
*.secret
*.token
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.json
appsettings.*.json     # local overrides only; the template appsettings.json stays tracked

### Windows app packaging  (Phase 6 distribution artifacts)
*.appx
*.appxbundle
*.appxupload
*.msix
*.msixbundle
*.msixupload
*.pdx
BundleArtifacts/

### OS / editor junk
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~

### Spec documents (local-only — UI-SPEC / AI-SPEC and any *SPEC.md)
*SPEC.md
**/*SPEC.md

### Planning docs (local-only)
.plan
.plan/
.planning/

### GSD runtime state  (machine/run-specific sentinels — regenerated each run, not portable)
.gsd/
.gsd
.gsd-id
.worktrees
.cache/
tmp/
.scratch/
.envrc

### Local browser / agent capture (not source)
.playwright-mcp/
